The "Schools Pupils and Characteristics" (SPC) data is published by DfE but finding it can be a challenge! The format of this dataset has changed over the years. Naming is not 100% consistent. 
Poast 2022(ish?) the originals can be found at URLs in this format:
https://explore-education-statistics.service.gov.uk/find-statistics/school-pupils-and-their-characteristics/2025-26/explore#supporting-files-section
It still needs navigating to the right link on that page. The school level csv files have been downloaded and saved here with consistent filenames. :-) 
